/fbc32067aee6068dd7f96aff1889deba76d5c838)\nThanks [@hntrl](https://github.com/hntrl)! - Add opt-in middleware\n`tracePolicy` support for transforming hook span input and output\npayloads, plus re-exports of LangGraph's `TracePolicy` and\n`omitPayload`.\n## @langchain/classic@1.0.47-rc.0\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- Updated dependencies\n[[`80c5c93`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs/commit/80c5c934d7768c842598c808b2c13a0a1b03e96a)]:\n  - @langchain/openai@1.5.12-rc.0\n## @langchain/anthropic@1.5.10-rc.0\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- [#11530](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs/pull/11530)\n[`c9b7eac`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs/commit/c9b7eac3523cbaa3aead92196d6bca275ebaf55c)\nThanks [@hntrl](https://github.com/hntrl)! - Add support for Claude\nFable 5.1.\n## @langchain/deepseek@1.1.12-rc.0\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- Updated dependencies\n[[`80c5c93`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs/commit/80c5c934d7768c842598c808b2c13a0a1b03e96a)]:\n  - @langchain/openai@1.5.12-rc.0\n## @langchain/fireworks@0.2.12-rc.0\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- Updated dependencies\n[[`80c5c93`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs/commit/80c5c934d7768c842598c808b2c13a0a1b03e96a)]:\n  - @langchain/openai@1.5.12-rc.0\n## @langchain/neo4j@0.1.19-rc.0\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- Updated dependencies []:\n  - @langchain/classic@1.0.47-rc.0\n## @langchain/openai@1.5.12-rc.0\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- [#11534](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs/pull/11534)\n[`80c5c93`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs/commit/80c5c934d7768c842598c808b2c13a0a1b03e96a)\nThanks [@chiliec](https://github.com/chiliec)! - Route gpt-5.6-sol to\nthe Responses API so function tools work with reasoning.\n## @langchain/openrouter@0.4.12-rc.0\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- Updated dependencies\n[[`80c5c93`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs/commit/80c5c934d7768c842598c808b2c13a0a1b03e96a)]:\n  - @langchain/openai@1.5.12-rc.0\n## @langchain/together-ai@0.2.12-rc.0\n\